#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF) – Released **June 2025**  \n"
msgstr "[Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF) – Wydany **w czerwcu 2025**  \n"

#. type: Plain text
